BALUCHISTAN LOCAL GOVERNMENT ORDINANCE, 1980
CHAPTER XIV‑DEVELOPMENT PLANS
78. Development Plans.‑.(1) A Local Council shall
prepare development plans which shall among other matters include the following
:‑‑
(a) nature and location of the scheme or schemes ;
(b) total estimated cost ;
(c) sources of finance',
(d) date of commencement ;
(e) date of completion ;
(f ) manner of execution ;
(g) agencies responsible for maintenance ;
(h) benefits, intangible or tangible to accrue ; and
(i) such other matters as may be necessary.
(2) The development plan of a Local Council shall be
sanctioned in its ordinary meeting.
(3) As far as may be, the schemes included in the
Development Plan shall be included in the budget.

